# <type>(<scope>): <short summary>  ← 50 chars max, no period
# |←————————————— 50 chars ——————————————→|
#
# WHY this change was made (wrap at 72 chars):
# |←————————————————————— 72 chars ————————————————————→|
#
# ── Types ──────────────────────────────────────────────
#  feat     new feature or capability
#  fix      bug fix
#  docker   Dockerfile / compose / image changes
#  config   YAML params, .env, launch args
#  world    Gazebo world / map files
#  launch   ROS2 launch files
#  test     adding or fixing tests
#  docs     README, comments, docstrings
#  chore    scaffolding, deps, repo setup
#  refactor code restructure, no behaviour change
#
# ── Scopes (optional) ──────────────────────────────────
#  metrics | adaptive | logger | dashboard
#  nav2    | sim      | docker | tests
#
# ── Examples ───────────────────────────────────────────
#  chore: initialise repository
#  docker: add baseline simulation image
#  feat: add odometry-based path tracking
#  fix: resolve X11 socket permission on Ubuntu
#  test: add unit tests for metrics helpers
#  docs: add setup and usage instructions to README
